- canonical: the preferred name (the most-used / clearest form, in Title Case). MUST be one of the grouped names.
- names: a list of TWO OR MORE names, taken VERBATIM from the list below, that refer to that one person.

If nothing should be merged, return {"merges": []}.

OUTPUT FORMAT — top-level key MUST be exactly `"merges"`:

